cycle.mdx","Ciclo de vida de un certificado","Emisión, uso, renovación, revocación y retirada de certificados en Lamassu.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle",{"_119":178},"platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle.mdx",{"_96":180,"_103":140,"_116":-7,"_98":181},"es:_2","Claves, autoridades y certificados",{"_96":183,"_103":113,"_98":184,"_107":185,"_116":-7,"_11":186,"_117":187},"es:platform/pki/key-management.mdx","Claves y motores criptográficos","Genera, importa y opera claves sin acoplar la PKI a un proveedor concreto.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/key-management",{"_119":188},"platform/pki/key-management.mdx",{"_96":190,"_103":113,"_98":191,"_107":192,"_116":-7,"_11":193,"_117":194},"es:platform/pki/certificate-authorities.mdx","Autoridades","Crea, importa y opera las autoridades que establecen la confianza de tu PKI.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities",{"_119":195},"platform/pki/certificate-authorities.mdx",{"_96":197,"_103":113,"_98":198,"_107":199,"_116":-7,"_11":200,"_117":201},"es:platform/pki/certificate-profiles.mdx","Perfiles de certificado","Define políticas reutilizables para emitir certificados coherentes y limitar las claves aceptadas.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/certificate-profiles",{"_119":202},"platform/pki/certificate-profiles.mdx",{"_96":204,"_103":113,"_98":205,"_107":206,"_116":-7,"_11":207,"_117":208},"es:platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation.mdx","Jerarquía y rotación","Diseña autoridades raíz e intermedias y sustituye certificados o claves sin romper la confianza.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation",{"_119":209},"platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation.mdx",{"_96":211,"_103":113,"_98":212,"_107":213,"_116":-7,"_11":214,"_117":215},"es:platform/pki/certificates.mdx","Certificados","Consulta, descarga y revoca los certificados emitidos por Lamassu.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/certificates",{"_119":216},"p